{"id": "e2f69836-1c73-490a-ac9e-8c3bb0a81b70", "slug": "nexus-digital-product-architecture", "title": "Nexus - Digital Product Architecture", "description": "Nexus Digital Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Nexus - Digital Product Architecture\"\ndescription: \"Nexus Digital Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#6366F1\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#6366F1\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"7px\"\n  control: \"7px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Nexus - Digital Product Architecture\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 179; favorites: 12; remixes: 2.\nTags: login, animated, input, validation, effect, security.\n## Overview\nNexus Digital Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\n\nNexus Platform Capabilities Ecosystem Solutions Pricing Documentation Sign in Initialize Real-time state Component sets Infinite topology Multiplayer sync T Nexus Engine 2.0 Available FRAMEWORK Architect, prototype, and…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: FRAMEWORK.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #6366F1, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #6366F1, background #FFFFFF, surface #FFFFFF, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Nexus - Digital Product Architecture</title>\n  \n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n  \n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"relative min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden text-zinc-300 bg-zinc-950 m-0 box-border antialiased selection:bg-indigo-500/30 selection:text-indigo-100\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 4rem 4rem; background-position: center center;\">\n\n  <!-- Ambient Glow Effects -->\n  <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[60vw] h-[60vh] bg-indigo-500/10 rounded-full blur-[8rem] pointer-events-none z-0\"></div>\n  <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-[40vw] h-[40vh] bg-cyan-500/5 rounded-full blur-[6rem] pointer-events-none z-0\"></div>\n\n  <section class=\"relative min-h-screen flex flex-col z-10\">\n    \n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <header class=\"fixed top-0 inset-x-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 bg-zinc-950/70 backdrop-blur-xl h-16 lg:h-20 px-6 lg:px-12\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-12\">\n        <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Nexus Home\" class=\"flex items-center gap-3 group\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-zinc-900 border border-white/10 shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] w-10 h-10 group-hover:border-indigo-500/50 transition-colors\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-zinc-100\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"font-semibold text-lg tracking-tight text-zinc-100\">Nexus</span>\n        </a>\n\n        <nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\" class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-8\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-normal text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors\">Platform</a>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-normal text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors\">Capabilities</a>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-normal text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors\">Ecosystem</a>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-normal text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors\">Solutions</a>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-normal text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors\">Pricing</a>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-normal text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors\">Documentation</a>\n        </nav>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"hidden lg:flex items-center gap-6\">\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-normal text-zinc-300 hover:text-zinc-100 transition-colors\">Sign in</a>\n        <!-- Button with Border Gradient -->\n        <div class=\"relative rounded-lg p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-indigo-400 to-indigo-600/20 shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(99,102,241,0.2)]\">\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center justify-center rounded-[7px] bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-100 text-sm font-semibold h-10 px-6 hover:bg-zinc-900 transition-colors\">\n            Initialize\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <button class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-md border border-white/10 bg-zinc-900 text-zinc-300 lg:hidden\" aria-label=\"Open menu\">\n        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n      </button>\n    </header>\n\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-center pt-32 pb-24 px-6 lg:px-12 w-full max-w-[1400px] mx-auto\">\n      \n      <!-- Gradient Border Feature Cards (Replaces floating notes) -->\n      \n      <!-- Top Left -->\n      <div class=\"absolute z-20 hidden lg:block left-[8%] top-[25%] -rotate-2 hover:rotate-0 hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\">\n        <div class=\"relative rounded-xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/20 to-transparent shadow-2xl shadow-black/50\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 px-5 py-4 bg-zinc-950/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-xl\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:refresh-circle-linear\" class=\"text-lg\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-200\">Real-time state</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Top Right -->\n      <div class=\"absolute z-20 hidden lg:block right-[10%] top-[20%] rotate-3 hover:rotate-0 hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\">\n        <div class=\"relative rounded-xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/20 to-transparent shadow-2xl shadow-black/50\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 px-5 py-4 bg-zinc-950/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-xl\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-400\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:widget-add-linear\" class=\"text-lg\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-200\">Component sets</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Bottom Left -->\n      <div class=\"absolute z-20 hidden lg:block left-[12%] bottom-[25%] rotate-2 hover:rotate-0 hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\">\n        <div class=\"relative rounded-xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/20 to-transparent shadow-2xl shadow-black/50\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 px-5 py-4 bg-zinc-950/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-xl\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:infinity-linear\" class=\"text-lg\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-200\">Infinite topology</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Bottom Right -->\n      <div class=\"absolute z-20 hidden lg:block right-[15%] bottom-[30%] -rotate-3 hover:rotate-0 hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\">\n        <div class=\"relative rounded-xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-white/20 to-transparent shadow-2xl shadow-black/50\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 px-5 py-4 bg-zinc-950/80 backdrop-blur-md rounded-xl\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-rose-500/20 text-rose-400\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:users-group-two-rounded-linear\" class=\"text-lg\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-200\">Multiplayer sync</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Floating Toolbar Dock -->\n      <aside class=\"absolute z-40 hidden xl:flex flex-col gap-4 left-10 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 p-[1px] rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/15 to-transparent\" aria-label=\"Workspace tools\">\n        <div class=\"bg-zinc-950/90 backdrop-blur-xl rounded-2xl p-3 shadow-2xl shadow-black\">\n          <button class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 mb-2 rounded-lg bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-100 shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)]\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cursor-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 mb-2 rounded-lg text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-100 hover:bg-zinc-800/50 transition-colors\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:move-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 mb-2 rounded-lg text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-100 hover:bg-zinc-800/50 font-semibold tracking-tight transition-colors text-base\">T</button>\n          <button class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 mb-2 rounded-lg text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-100 hover:bg-zinc-800/50 transition-colors\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pen-new-square-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n          </button>\n          <button class=\"flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-lg text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-100 hover:bg-zinc-800/50 transition-colors\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:box-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </aside>\n\n      <!-- Center Typography Section -->\n      <div class=\"relative z-20 flex flex-col items-center text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full\">\n        \n        <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 mb-8 rounded-full border border-indigo-500/30 bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-300 text-xs font-semibold tracking-tight\">\n          <span class=\"flex w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-400 animate-pulse\"></span>\n          Nexus Engine 2.0 Available\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Animated Bounding Box -->\n        <div class=\"canvas-select-box relative w-full px-4 py-6 md:py-8 mb-8 z-10 flex justify-center\">\n          \n          <!-- Drawing Borders -->\n          <span class=\"draw-border-top absolute top-0 left-0 h-[1px] bg-indigo-500 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(99,102,241,0.8)] w-0\"></span>\n          <span class=\"draw-border-right absolute top-0 right-0 w-[1px] bg-indigo-500 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(99,102,241,0.8)] h-0\"></span>\n          <span class=\"draw-border-bottom absolute bottom-0 right-0 h-[1px] bg-indigo-500 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(99,102,241,0.8)] w-0\"></span>\n          <span class=\"draw-border-left absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-[1px] bg-indigo-500 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(99,102,241,0.8)] h-0\"></span>\n\n          <!-- Pop-in Corner Handles -->\n          <span class=\"canvas-handle absolute w-2 h-2 border border-indigo-500 bg-zinc-950 opacity-0 scale-0 -top-1 -left-1\"></span>\n          <span class=\"canvas-handle absolute w-2 h-2 border border-indigo-500 bg-zinc-950 opacity-0 scale-0 -top-1 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2\"></span>\n          <span class=\"canvas-handle absolute w-2 h-2 border border-indigo-500 bg-zinc-950 opacity-0 scale-0 -top-1 -right-1\"></span>\n          <span class=\"canvas-handle absolute w-2 h-2 border border-indigo-500 bg-zinc-950 opacity-0 scale-0 top-1/2 -left-1 -translate-y-1/2\"></span>\n          <span class=\"canvas-handle absolute w-2 h-2 border border-indigo-500 bg-zinc-950 opacity-0 scale-0 top-1/2 -right-1 -translate-y-1/2\"></span>\n          <span class=\"canvas-handle absolute w-2 h-2 border border-indigo-500 bg-zinc-950 opacity-0 scale-0 -bottom-1 -left-1\"></span>\n          <span class=\"canvas-handle absolute w-2 h-2 border border-indigo-500 bg-zinc-950 opacity-0 scale-0 -bottom-1 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2\"></span>\n          <span class=\"canvas-handle absolute w-2 h-2 border border-indigo-500 bg-zinc-950 opacity-0 scale-0 -bottom-1 -right-1\"></span>\n\n          <h1 class=\"m-0 font-semibold leading-none tracking-tighter text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-white/40 text-6xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl relative z-10 py-2\">\n            FRAMEWORK\n          </h1>\n\n          <!-- Drawing cursor -->\n          <div id=\"draw-cursor\" class=\"absolute z-50 w-8 h-8 text-indigo-400 drop-shadow-[0_2px_10px_rgba(99,102,241,0.5)] -rotate-12 pointer-events-none origin-top-left\" style=\"top: -4px; left: -4px;\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"#09090b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"w-full h-full\">\n              <path d=\"M4.1 4.3c-.3-.1-.6.2-.5.5l6.8 15.8c.2.4.8.4.9-.1l1.7-6.5c.1-.5.5-.8 1-1l6.5-1.6c.5-.1.6-.8.1-1L4.1 4.3Z\"></path>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Masked Staggered Word Reveal -->\n        <p class=\"canvas-subtitle mx-auto max-w-2xl font-normal leading-snug tracking-tight text-xl md:text-2xl text-zinc-400 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 mt-6\">\n          <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[120%]\">Architect,</span></span>\n          <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[120%]\">prototype,</span></span>\n          <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[120%]\">and</span></span>\n          <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[120%]\">scale</span></span>\n          <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[120%]\">your</span></span>\n          <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[120%] text-zinc-200 font-semibold relative\">product<span class=\"absolute -bottom-1 left-0 right-0 h-[1px] bg-indigo-500/50\"></span></span></span>\n          <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[120%] text-zinc-200 font-semibold relative\">vision<span class=\"absolute -bottom-1 left-0 right-0 h-[1px] bg-indigo-500/50\"></span></span></span>\n          <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[120%]\">in</span></span>\n          <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[120%]\">a</span></span>\n          <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[120%]\">unified,</span></span>\n          <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[120%]\">high-performance</span></span>\n          <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[120%]\">visual</span></span>\n          <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[120%]\">environment.</span></span>\n        </p>\n\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 mt-12 w-full max-w-md mx-auto z-20\">\n          <div class=\"relative rounded-lg p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-200 to-zinc-500 w-full sm:w-auto shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(255,255,255,0.2)] transition-shadow\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-[7px] font-semibold tracking-tight bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-950 h-12 px-8 text-sm w-full transition-transform hover:scale-[0.98]\">\n              Deploy Workspace\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-lg\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n            </a>\n          </div>\n          <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg font-semibold tracking-tight border border-white/10 bg-transparent text-zinc-300 hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-zinc-100 h-12 px-8 text-sm w-full sm:w-auto transition-colors\">\n            Explore Capabilities\n          </a>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </main>\n  </section>\n\n  <script>\n    document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n      gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n      // 1. Masked Staggered Word Reveal\n      gsap.to(\".reveal-word\", {\n        y: \"0%\",\n        stagger: 0.04,\n        duration: 0.8,\n        ease: \"power4.out\",\n        scrollTrigger: {\n          trigger: \".canvas-subtitle\",\n          start: \"top 90%\"\n        }\n      });\n\n      // 2. Seamless Cursor Drawing Animation Loop\n      const tl = gsap.timeline({ repeat: -1, repeatDelay: 0.8 });\n      const cOffset = -4; // Offset to align cursor tip with handles/borders\n\n      // Initial state\n      gsap.set(\"#draw-cursor\", { left: cOffset, top: cOffset, scale: 1 });\n\n      // Draw Top Border\n      tl.to(\"#draw-cursor\", { left: `calc(100% + ${cOffset}px)`, duration: 0.8, ease: \"power2.inOut\" }, \"drawTop\")\n        .to(\".draw-border-top\", { width: \"100%\", duration: 0.8, ease: \"power2.inOut\" }, \"drawTop\");\n\n      // Draw Right Border\n      tl.to(\"#draw-cursor\", { top: `calc(100% + ${cOffset}px)`, duration: 0.8, ease: \"power2.inOut\" }, \"drawRight\")\n        .to(\".draw-border-right\", { height: \"100%\", duration: 0.8, ease: \"power2.inOut\" }, \"drawRight\");\n\n      // Draw Bottom Border\n      tl.to(\"#draw-cursor\", { left: cOffset, duration: 0.8, ease: \"power2.inOut\" }, \"drawBottom\")\n        .to(\".draw-border-bottom\", { width: \"100%\", duration: 0.8, ease: \"power2.inOut\" }, \"drawBottom\");\n\n      // Draw Left Border\n      tl.to(\"#draw-cursor\", { top: cOffset, duration: 0.8, ease: \"power2.inOut\" }, \"drawLeft\")\n        .to(\".draw-border-left\", { height: \"100%\", duration: 0.8, ease: \"power2.inOut\" }, \"drawLeft\");\n\n      // Pop in handles\n      tl.to(\".canvas-handle\", { scale: 1, opacity: 1, duration: 0.4, stagger: 0.03, ease: \"back.out(2)\" });\n\n      // Move cursor down to bottom-right handle\n      tl.to(\"#draw-cursor\", {\n        left: `calc(100% + ${cOffset}px)`,\n        top: `calc(100% + ${cOffset}px)`,\n        duration: 0.7,\n        ease: \"power3.inOut\"\n      });\n\n      // Simulate Click/Drag Interaction\n      tl.to(\"#draw-cursor\", { scale: 0.8, duration: 0.1 });\n      \n      // Slight resize scaling\n      tl.to(\".canvas-select-box\", {\n        scale: 1.02,\n        transformOrigin: \"top left\",\n        duration: 0.6,\n        ease: \"power2.out\"\n      }, \"resize\");\n\n      // Release click\n      tl.to(\"#draw-cursor\", { scale: 1, duration: 0.1 }, \"+=0.2\");\n\n      // Snap back\n      tl.to(\".canvas-select-box\", {\n        scale: 1,\n        duration: 0.5,\n        ease: \"power3.inOut\"\n      }, \"+=0.1\");\n\n      // Fade out reset\n      tl.to(\".canvas-handle\", { scale: 0, opacity: 0, duration: 0.3 }, \"reset\")\n        .to(\".draw-border-top, .draw-border-bottom\", { width: 0, duration: 0.3 }, \"reset\")\n        .to(\".draw-border-right, .draw-border-left\", { height: 0, duration: 0.3 }, \"reset\")\n        .to(\"#draw-cursor\", { left: cOffset, top: cOffset, duration: 0.6, ease: \"power3.inOut\" }, \"reset\");\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nexus-digital-product-architecture.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/nexus-digital-product-architecture.jpg", "source_name": "nexus-digital-product-architecture-DESIGN.md", "views": 223, "forks": 6, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-06-12T07:38:10.793894+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T17:32:43.325297+00:00"}